learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-17T16:34:18.129Z","harness:codex","A preventive scanner and a post-commit scanner must share their detector inventory. Declare scope exceptions in that inventory and test all shared rule names plus representative values, so adding a rule cannot silently leave immutable writes unprotected."
